  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Massa couldn't catch me, my legs long than a bitch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Got too much self-respect, I wash my hands before I piss",
          "rhyme": "ajs",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "They try to talk me, ehm...",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Yeah, when I turned twenty-three, that's when puberty finally hit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "My facial hair started growin', my clothing ain't really fit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "That caterpillar went to cocoon, do you get me?",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "See, I was shiftin', that's really why Cherry Bomb sounded so shifty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "My taste started changin' from what it was (When they met me)",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But first impression is everything, ain't wanna let me go",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Always curious as a child and askin' questions, so",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I ain't give no fucks, if, and, buts if they accept me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Yo, my boy Skateboard P gave me that speech in Italy session, um",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Thankfully, by hour three, detoured perspective, um",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Thoughts changed so rapid, turned to butterfly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "All the bees buzzed me, the bugs screamed they loved (Me)",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "First time I private airlined, accolades, song got airtime",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Grew into my style, body, and feelings, and fixed my hairline",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Calmed down in front of cameras, business hit tens of millions",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I'm not that little boy you was introduced to at nineteen",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "My mom was in the shelter when \"Yonkers\" dropped (I don't say it)",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "When I got her out, that's the moment I knew I made it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "I don't come from money, they deny it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "'Cause I don't mirror the stereotypical products of my environment",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Ten million in taxes taken, that shit is (Stupid)",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "The flower gets its petal, they pluck it, but never (Use it)",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "It's still potholes in the schools, where does it go?",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "It's still loopholes that I use (Nobody knows)",
          "rhyme": "yz",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCBDEECFFBGHIJIGAAKLGEM",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABACDDBEEAFAAGAFAAHIFDJ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Massa couldn't catch me, my legs long than a bitch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Got too much self-respect, I wash my hands before I piss",
          "rhyme": "ajs",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "They try to talk me up, I keep short like Caesar",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Eyes open if I pray, I can't trust God either, no",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCD",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABBC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "interlude",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Seein' that we only get one life to live",
          "rhyme": "iv",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "How far do you really wanna take it?",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Don't let 'em ever tell you nothin' you can't do",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Yeah, I purchase more wheels when I feel like I'm third-wheelin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "My favorite in that Rolls-Royce is the bird ceilin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "The panoramic view of the sky and the sun beamin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "That ray of light show that nobody is front-seatin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I'm on the hunt for perfect but decent is what I been on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I know she fell in love, but commitment was not my end goal",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And all my friends that did got too comfy, a little chubby",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "And that drive to make that money dried up when that nose was runny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "We ain't gotta pay attention to the shit that I battle",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "'Cause everyone I ever loved had to be loved in the shadows",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Tug-of-war with X and Y felt like a custody battle",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Felt like the boat goin' down, it felt like I'm missin' a paddle",
          "rhyme": "9dl",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Might buy that crib... (Lackin' gravel; yeah)",
          "rhyme": "ib",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "It come with two boats (And cattle), I'm livin' sweet, ain't you heard? (Ain't you heard, nigga?)",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "This perspective from the beak of a bird",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "You hope I peak, you take my peace",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "You gon' see me and run like thieves in the night",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "I'm paranoid, I sleep with a gun",
          "rhyme": "9n",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "The heat on my dungaroos because they beefin' for fun",
          "rhyme": "yn",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "I'm vegan for now, I'm conscious, know my hands meet when I bow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "I'm grateful, you niggas hateful, you eat at me, you got a plate full",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "You can't relate to these things I say to these instrumentals",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Whether it's money talk or shit that's painful",
          "rhyme": "9l",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "I paint full pictures of my perspective on these drum breaks",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Just for y'all to tell me I'm not good from your lunch break",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AAAABCDDEFEGHIJKLMNFOPQRR",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAAABCDDECEFDEGEEFHCIEFGG"
    },
    {
